  {
   "id": "cb_ecc81761748c12fbf820e8ad",
   "order": 2,
   "title_en": "Display of PLA Sparkle Prints",
   "body_en": "Bambu PLA Sparkle is a next-level aesthetic filament that combines strength and sparkle. With metal particles included in its composition, Bambu PLA Sparkle adds a special sparkling look to your prints that sets them apart from the rest.\nHowever, it is not recommended to use a 0.2 mm nozzle for printing as clogging may occur. Take your 3D printing projects to new heights with Bambu PLA Sparkle!",
