  {
   "id": "cb_18fb71bbe8864ff85ab49a37",
   "order": 10,
   "title_en": "FAQ",
   "body_en": "1.Accessory Compatibility\nNot compatible with Hotend with Stainless Steel Nozzle 0.2 mm.\n\n2.Drying Recommendations\nDry before use to ensure the best print quality and consistent finish. Store in a dry environment after use. For more details, please refer to: Filament drying instructions on WIKI.\nFor opened filament, we recommend drying before use according to the wiki’s recommended temperature and time settings.\n\n3.Safety Tips\nPlease store the filament in a cool, dark, and dry environment away from direct sunlight and high temperatures.\nPlease keep filament and any broken fragments out of reach of infants, children, and pets to prevent swallowing or choking.\nPlease print this filament in a well-ventilated area, or install an effective air filtration or exhaust system.\nAs this filament is not food-grade, please avoid using finished prints for food storage or contact.",
   "url": "",
   "source_media_id": "",
   "source_url": "",
   "alt_en": "",
   "alt_ar": "",
   "alt_ckb": "",
   "kind": "text",
